              <CodeBlock code={`static long[] memo = new long[1000];

public static long fibonacciMemo(int n) {
    if (n <= 1) return n;
    if (memo[n] != 0) return memo[n];
    memo[n] = fibonacciMemo(n - 1) + fibonacciMemo(n - 2);
    return memo[n];
}`} lang="java" />
              <p className="text-sm text-green-500 mt-2">Zamiast ~300 milionow wywolan, teraz tylko ~200!</p>
